State":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The second daughter of the Ashina siblings. She works at a bento shop. She's plain and unremarkable, yet possesses the largest bust among the three sisters."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a child, she was a caring and considerate girl, but now she avoids trouble and shows little interest in others. Her policy is to steer clear of hassle and conflict, living a peaceful life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She schemes to keep her younger brother all to herself, more than she cares about the inheritance itself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Will the day ever come when she opens her heart and rediscovers her feelings for her family?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1952"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"芦名四姉弟の次女。28歳"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弁当の販売店で働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の知る彼女は、面倒見がよく気配りの出来る女の子だったが、現在は事なかれ主義の他人に無関心な女性になってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地味で目だ立たないものの、三姉妹で最大の巨乳を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"面倒なことや争いごとを好まず、遺産そのものには興味がなく、主人公を自分のものにしたいと考えているようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22674","sourceWorkId":"7639","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"芦名四姉弟の次女。弁当販売店で働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地味で目立たないが、三姉妹最大の巨乳の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼少期は面倒見がよく気配りのできる女の子だったが、現在は事なかれ主義で他人に無関心。面倒や争い事は避け、平穏な生活を送るのがポリシー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"遺産そのものよりも、弟を自分だけのものにしようと図る。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62813"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"28 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22674","sourceWorkId":"7639","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"102 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22674","sourceWorkId":"7639","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"h","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","s